    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d304">

                <pb facs="0427" n="[427]" sameAs="frus:frus1861/pg427"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Turpin to Mr. Seward</hi>.</head>
                <note rend="inline" type="source">[Extract.]</note>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 45.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the
                            United States</hi>,<lb/><placeName><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Caracas</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1861-07-27"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >July</hi> 27, 1861</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: * * * * * * * *</p>
                <p>The President has promised me to issue instructions to all <hi
                        rendition="#italic">comandantes de puerto</hi> of the republic prohibiting
                    admission of all vessels under that [the confedate] flag into its ports, except
                    in cases of distress. I could not obtain from him their complete denunciation as
                    pirates.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * * * *</p>
                <p>I have the honor, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>E. A. TURPIN.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wm. H. Seward</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Secretary of State</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
